---
import PageLayout from '~/layouts/PageLayout.astro';

const metadata = {
  title: 'Who We Are',
  description:
    'Southern Connecticut Mensa is a welcoming community of curious, like-minded people in Fairfield County, Connecticut.',
};
---

<PageLayout metadata={metadata}>
  <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-10 md:py-14">
    <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Who We Are</h1>

    <p class="mt-4 text-base md:text-lg text-muted dark:text-gray-300">
      Southern Connecticut Mensa is the local Mensa chapter serving <strong>Fairfield County, Connecticut</strong>. Our
      members come from many backgrounds and walks of life, but what we share is curiosity, connection, and a genuine
      enjoyment of exploring ideas together.
    </p>

    <p class="mt-4 text-base md:text-lg text-muted dark:text-gray-300">
      We’re a community of like-minded people with shared experiences around being intelligent. We get together to have
      fun, meet new and interesting people, and challenge our minds. It’s a welcoming community where it’s okay to be
      yourself.
    </p>

    <hr class="my-10 border-gray-200 dark:border-slate-800" />

    <h2 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-semibold">What We Do</h2>

    <p class="mt-4 text-sm md:text-base text-muted dark:text-gray-300">
      Our events cover a wide range of interests, and no two members participate in exactly the same way.
    </p>

    <p class="mt-3 text-sm md:text-base text-muted dark:text-gray-300">
      Some gatherings are purely social — dinners, barbecues, bowling nights, or casual get-togethers where the focus is
      simply spending time together.
    </p>

    <p class="mt-3 text-sm md:text-base text-muted dark:text-gray-300">
      Others blend social and mind-engaging activities, like escape rooms, game nights, local trivia events, and group
      challenges where conversation and collaboration naturally happen along the way.
    </p>

    <p class="mt-3 text-sm md:text-base text-muted dark:text-gray-300">
      We also host intellectual events such as speaker presentations and discussions. These are often led by members or
      local experts and cover topics of all kinds — from space, engineering, cryptocurrency, and finance to sports,
      entertainment, and more.
    </p>

    <p class="mt-3 text-sm md:text-base text-muted dark:text-gray-300">
      Beyond our local chapter, members often participate in <strong>Mind Games</strong>, as well as regional and
      national Mensa gatherings held throughout the country.
    </p>

    <p class="mt-4 text-sm md:text-base text-muted dark:text-gray-300 font-medium">
      You come to the events that interest you. There’s no single “right” way to participate.
    </p>

    <p class="mt-2 text-sm md:text-base text-muted dark:text-gray-300">
      People come for different reasons and participate in different ways, but the common thread is curiosity,
      openness, and enjoying the company of like-minded people.
    </p>

    <hr class="my-10 border-gray-200 dark:border-slate-800" />

    <h2 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-semibold">Guests &amp; Partners</h2>

    <p class="mt-4 text-sm md:text-base text-muted dark:text-gray-300">
      Spouses, partners, and guests are often welcome at social events, and many members attend together.
    </p>

    <p class="mt-2 text-sm md:text-base text-muted dark:text-gray-300">
      Each event listing notes whether guests are invited, so it’s easy to know what to expect.
    </p>

    <hr class="my-10 border-gray-200 dark:border-slate-800" />

    <h2 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-semibold">What Is Mensa?</h2>

    <p class="mt-4 text-sm md:text-base text-muted dark:text-gray-300">
      Mensa is an international society open to people who score in the top 2% on an accepted standardized intelligence
      test.
    </p>

    <p class="mt-2 text-sm md:text-base text-muted dark:text-gray-300">
      There are Mensa chapters around the world. In the United States, local chapters operate under <strong>American
      Mensa</strong> while also being part of the broader international organization.
    </p>

    <p class="mt-2 text-sm md:text-base text-muted dark:text-gray-300">
      Local chapters like Southern Connecticut Mensa exist to bring members together for connection, shared interests,
      and community.
    </p>

    <hr class="my-10 border-gray-200 dark:border-slate-800" />

    <h2 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-semibold">Leadership</h2>

    <p class="mt-4 text-sm md:text-base text-muted dark:text-gray-300">
      Southern Connecticut Mensa is run entirely by volunteers. Leadership exists to support the community — organizing
      events, handling communications, and helping create opportunities for members to connect.
    </p>

    <p class="mt-2 text-sm md:text-base text-muted dark:text-gray-300">
      If you’re interested in getting involved, whether by helping with events, sharing ideas, or supporting the
      chapter in other ways, we’re always happy to hear from you.
    </p>
  </section>
</PageLayout>
